                     <title>Petrus Blesensis, De vera amicitia</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Later at Durham, q. v.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">The Winchester inscription is on fol. 73v, all
                        from "Quem" being partly erased. Since there is no change of hand at this
                        point it seems possible that the inscription is taken over from the
                        exemplar. The last word probably begins "Longe", followed by about 4 letters
                        and "a".</note>
                  </msItem>
